@startuml F1.3-D02-upload-foto
title F1.3-D02 — Upload de foto (POST /me/foto)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "ProfileController" as Ctrl
participant "MinIO" as MinIO
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: confirma crop circular
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /me/foto\n(multipart)
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok

note right of Ctrl
  Browser NÃO faz PUT no MinIO
  Upload só via API
end note

Ctrl -> MinIO: armazena imagem
MinIO --> Ctrl: OK
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE foto_perfil
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + URL avatar
WebApp --> Aluno: DS/Avatar atualizado

@enduml
